<title>USA: Peru's Ferreyros Q1 oper income rises.</title>
<headline>Peru's Ferreyros Q1 oper income rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands of nuevos soles, except per share)</p>
<p>			     For the quarter ended March 31,</p>
<p>				  1997		  1996</p>
<p>Net sales		   116,981		87,756</p>
<p>Operating income	    9,690		 7,161</p>
<p>Net income		    4,183		 3,607</p>
<p>Earnings per share	   0.0527		0.0529</p>
<p>Number of shares used</p>
<p> in computing EPS	   79,407	     62,839</p>
<p>Full company name is Ferreyros S.A., a Lima, Peru,-based distsributor of heavy machinery and equipment.</p>
<p>--((New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
